{"seq":3,"slug":"structured-fuzzing","title":"结构化模糊测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/fuzzing/structured-fuzzing","wordCount":1622,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"结构化模糊测试\">结构化模糊测试</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>结构化模糊测试通过将输入格式知识注入模糊器来突破&quot;格式壁垒&quot;——在输入的结构化表示（AST、类型化记录、协议状态机）上进行变异而非在原始字节上。关键技术包括语法驱动模糊（CFG 级变异）、协议状态模糊（序列级变异）、结构感知变异（类型安全字段级变异）和字典注入（轻量级 token 指导）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要结构化模糊\">为什么需要结构化模糊</h2><p>纯字节级变异（bitflip、arithmetic）在面对有格式约束的输入时效率急剧下降。考虑一个 JSON 解析器：随机翻转几个位几乎必然产生语法无效的输入，被解析器的第一行校验直接拒绝——模糊器永远无法深入解析器的核心逻辑。</p>\n<p>这就是&quot;格式壁垒&quot;（format barrier）问题。据估计，对结构化输入的黑盒/纯变异模糊，超过 95% 的生成输入被解析器前端拒绝。结构化模糊测试通过将输入格式的知识注入模糊器来突破这一壁垒。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 纯字节变异&#10;    A[种子字节] --&gt; B[位翻转/字节替换]&#10;    B --&gt; C[95%语法无效]&#10;    C --&gt; D[早期拒绝]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 结构化模糊&#10;    E[种子 AST] --&gt; F[结构感知变异]&#10;    F --&gt; G[大部分语法有效]&#10;    G --&gt; H[深入核心逻辑]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 纯字节变异\n    A[种子字节] --&gt; B[位翻转/字节替换]\n    B --&gt; C[95%语法无效]\n    C --&gt; D[早期拒绝]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 结构化模糊\n    E[种子 AST] --&gt; F[结构感知变异]\n    F --&gt; G[大部分语法有效]\n    G --&gt; H[深入核心逻辑]\n    end</pre><p>结构化模糊测试的核心思想是：<strong>在输入的结构化表示（AST、类型化记录、协议状态机）上进行变异，然后序列化为字节流送入被测程序</strong>。这保证了变异后的输入在结构层面仍然合法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"语法驱动模糊测试\">语法驱动模糊测试</h2><p>语法驱动模糊测试（Grammar-Based Fuzzing）使用上下文无关文法（CFG）或类似形式化描述来指导输入生成：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"// JSON 的简化语法&#10;value   := object | array | string | number | &quot;true&quot; | &quot;false&quot; | &quot;null&quot;&#10;object  := &quot;{&quot; members &quot;}&quot;&#10;members := pair (&quot;,&quot; pair)*&#10;pair    := string &quot;:&quot; value&#10;array   := &quot;[&quot; elements &quot;]&quot;&#10;elements:= value (&quot;,&quot; value)*\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// JSON 的简化语法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>value   := object | array | string | number | \"true\" | \"false\" | \"null\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>object  := \"{\" members \"}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>members := pair (\",\" pair)*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pair    := string \":\" value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>array   := \"[\" elements \"]\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>elements:= value (\",\" value)*</span></span></code></pre></div><p>基于语法的模糊器在产生式规则（production rules）的层面进行变异：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变异类型</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>子树替换</td>\n<td>用同类型子树替换一个子树</td>\n<td><code>{&quot;a&quot;: 1}</code> → <code>{&quot;a&quot;: [true]}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子树生长</td>\n<td>递归展开一个叶节点</td>\n<td><code>null</code> → <code>{&quot;k&quot;: null}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子树剪枝</td>\n<td>将子树收缩为最简形式</td>\n<td><code>[1,[2,[3]]]</code> → <code>[1]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子树重复</td>\n<td>复制子树到兄弟位置</td>\n<td><code>[1,2]</code> → <code>[1,2,1,2]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规则突变</td>\n<td>选择替代产生式</td>\n<td><code>value→string</code> → <code>value→number</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Nautilus</strong>（Aschermann et al. 2019）是语法驱动模糊的代表工具，它将语法表示为扁平化的&quot;chunk table&quot;，支持快速的子树级变异操作。2026 年 Trail of Bits 的 gosentry 将 Nautilus 引擎引入 Go 生态，使 Go 开发者可以用语法驱动模糊测试解析器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"协议状态模糊\">协议状态模糊</h2><p>网络协议（HTTP、TLS、gRPC 等）的输入不是单一消息，而是<em>有状态的消息序列</em>。协议模糊需要维护会话状态：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; Connected&#10;    Connected --&gt; Authenticated: LOGIN&#10;    Connected --&gt; Connected: INVALID_CMD&#10;    Authenticated --&gt; DataReady: SELECT&#10;    Authenticated --&gt; Authenticated: NOOP&#10;    DataReady --&gt; DataReady: FETCH&#10;    DataReady --&gt; Authenticated: CLOSE&#10;    Authenticated --&gt; [*]: LOGOUT\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; Connected\n    Connected --&gt; Authenticated: LOGIN\n    Connected --&gt; Connected: INVALID_CMD\n    Authenticated --&gt; DataReady: SELECT\n    Authenticated --&gt; Authenticated: NOOP\n    DataReady --&gt; DataReady: FETCH\n    DataReady --&gt; Authenticated: CLOSE\n    Authenticated --&gt; [*]: LOGOUT</pre><p>协议状态模糊的策略：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>状态图建模</strong>：从协议规范或实现代码中提取状态机</li>\n<li><strong>状态敏感变异</strong>：在不同状态下应用不同的变异策略（登录状态的消息 vs 未认证状态的消息）</li>\n<li><strong>序列变异</strong>：不仅变异单个消息，还变异消息的顺序、重复和缺失</li>\n<li><strong>覆盖率反馈</strong>：用状态转换覆盖率（而非纯代码覆盖率）引导探索</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>AFLNet</strong> 是专为有状态协议设计的灰盒模糊器。它的创新在于：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>从网络流量中学习状态转换图</li>\n<li>用&quot;状态序列覆盖率&quot;作为反馈信号</li>\n<li>在状态级别选择模糊目标（优先探索罕见状态）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"结构感知变异-struct-aware-fuzzing\">结构感知变异（Struct-Aware Fuzzing）</h2><p>对于接受结构化数据类型（而非原始字节）的 API，可以在类型化的结构体级别做变异：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// Go: 结构感知模糊（gosentry 支持）&#10;func FuzzProcessRequest(f *testing.F) {&#10;    f.Fuzz(func(t *testing.T, method string, path string,&#10;                 bodyLen uint16, timeout uint32) {&#10;        req := Request{&#10;            Method:  method,&#10;            Path:    path,&#10;            Body:    make([]byte, bodyLen),&#10;            Timeout: time.Duration(timeout) * time.Millisecond,&#10;        }&#10;        ProcessRequest(req) // 不应 panic&#10;    })&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Go: 结构感知模糊（gosentry 支持）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FuzzProcessRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">f</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">testing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">F</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    f.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Fuzz</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">testing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">method</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">path</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                 bodyLen</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> uint16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">timeout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> uint32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        req </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            Method:  method,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            Path:    path,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            Body:    </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">make</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">byte</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, bodyLen),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            Timeout: time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(timeout) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.Millisecond,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        ProcessRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(req) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不应 panic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在 C/C++ 生态，libprotobuf-mutator 是结构感知模糊的标准工具——它使用 Protocol Buffers 定义输入结构，然后对 protobuf 消息进行类型安全的变异：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"protobuf\" data-code=\"// 定义输入结构&#10;message HttpRequest {&#10;    enum Method { GET = 0; POST = 1; PUT = 2; DELETE = 3; }&#10;    Method method = 1;&#10;    string path = 2;&#10;    map&lt;string, string&gt; headers = 3;&#10;    bytes body = 4;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 定义输入结构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>message HttpRequest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    enum Method { GET = 0; POST = 1; PUT = 2; DELETE = 3; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Method method = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    string path = 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    map&#x3C;string, string> headers = 3;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    bytes body = 4;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>变异操作在 protobuf 消息级别进行：添加/删除字段、改变枚举值、变异字符串内容——所有变异都保证类型安全。</p>\n<h2 id=\"字典与魔术值注入\">字典与魔术值注入</h2><p>介于纯字节变异和完整语法建模之间的轻量级方案是<strong>字典模式</strong>——为模糊器提供一组关键词/token：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# JSON 字典 (json.dict)&#10;kw_true=&quot;true&quot;&#10;kw_false=&quot;false&quot;&#10;kw_null=&quot;null&quot;&#10;token_open_brace=&quot;{&quot;&#10;token_close_brace=&quot;}&quot;&#10;token_open_bracket=&quot;[&quot;&#10;token_close_bracket=&quot;]&quot;&#10;token_colon=&quot;:&quot;&#10;token_comma=&quot;,&quot;&#10;token_quote=&quot;\\&quot;&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># JSON 字典 (json.dict)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>kw_true=\"true\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>kw_false=\"false\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>kw_null=\"null\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>token_open_brace=\"{\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>token_close_brace=\"}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>token_open_bracket=\"[\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>token_close_bracket=\"]\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>token_colon=\":\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>token_comma=\",\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>token_quote=\"\\\"\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>模糊器在变异时优先将字典中的 token 插入/替换到输入中。这显著提高了突破格式校验的概率，而成本仅是维护一个文本文件。</p>\n<p>AFL 和 LibFuzzer 都支持字典模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# AFL 使用字典&#10;afl-fuzz -x json.dict -i seeds/ -o findings/ -- ./json_parser @@&#10;&#10;# LibFuzzer 使用字典&#10;./json_fuzzer -dict=json.dict corpus/\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># AFL 使用字典</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">afl-fuzz</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -x</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> json.dict</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> seeds/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> findings/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./json_parser</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @@</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># LibFuzzer 使用字典</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./json_fuzzer</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -dict=json.dict</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> corpus/</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"比较操作建模-cmplog-value-profile\">比较操作建模（CmpLog / Value Profile）</h2><p>路径约束中最常见的障碍是比较操作：<code>if (magic == 0xCAFEBABE)</code>。纯随机变异命中 4 字节魔术数字的概率是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>32</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{2^{32}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7463em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>——几乎不可能。</p>\n<p>现代模糊器通过插桩比较指令来解决此问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CmpLog</td>\n<td>AFL++</td>\n<td>记录比较操作的双方操作数，生成&quot;拼接&quot;变异</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Value Profile</td>\n<td>LibFuzzer</td>\n<td>将比较操作数的汉明距离变化视为新覆盖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LAF-Intel</td>\n<td>AFL</td>\n<td>将多字节比较拆分为逐字节比较</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Redqueen</td>\n<td>直接</td>\n<td>自动检测魔术字节并直接替换</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// LAF-Intel 的拆分效果&#10;// 原始：&#10;if (input == 0xDEADBEEF) { ... }&#10;&#10;// 拆分后（编译时）：&#10;if (input_byte[0] == 0xDE)&#10;  if (input_byte[1] == 0xAD)&#10;    if (input_byte[2] == 0xBE)&#10;      if (input_byte[3] == 0xEF) { ... }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// LAF-Intel 的拆分效果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 原始：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (input </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">DEADBEEF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) { ... }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 拆分后（编译时）：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">input_byte</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">DE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">input_byte</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">AD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">input_byte</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">BE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">input_byte</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">EF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) { ... }</span></span></code></pre></div><p>拆分后每个字节比较可以独立被覆盖率引导发现，将 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>32</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{2^{32}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7463em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的概率降为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4 \\times \\frac{1}{2^8}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7463em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模糊测试的工程实践要点\">模糊测试的工程实践要点</h2><p><strong>资源分配</strong>：模糊测试本质上是计算密集型的——更多 CPU 时间 = 更高的发现概率。实践中的经验法则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>安全关键代码：每个模糊目标至少 24 小时连续模糊</li>\n<li>常规代码：CI 中分配 10-30 分钟的短期模糊</li>\n<li>核心解析器：接入 OSS-Fuzz 获得持续模糊</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>目标函数设计原则</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>目标函数应当<strong>快速</strong>——避免 I/O、网络、大内存分配</li>\n<li>目标函数应当<strong>确定性</strong>——相同输入产生相同行为</li>\n<li>目标函数应当<strong>无全局状态</strong>——每次调用独立</li>\n<li>目标应当<strong>窄</strong>——一个目标测一个功能，不是整个程序</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>结构化模糊测试通过在 AST/语法/协议状态层面而非字节层面进行变异，将有效输入比例从不到 5% 提升到大部分语法合法——使模糊器深入核心逻辑。语法驱动（Nautilus）适用于有形式化语法的解析器；协议状态模糊（AFLNet）适用于有状态网络服务；结构感知变异（libprotobuf-mutator、Go struct fuzzing）适用于类型化 API；字典模式是最轻量的中间方案。CmpLog/Value Profile 等技术解决了路径约束中的魔术数字障碍。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>sibling-link</strong>: 模糊测试验证&quot;代码不崩溃&quot;，属性测试验证&quot;代码行为正确&quot;；但如何验证<em>测试本身</em>是否有效？变异测试给出了答案。见 <a href=\"../mutation/mutation-testing-principles\">变异测试原理</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"结构化模糊测试","id":"结构化模糊测试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要结构化模糊","id":"为什么需要结构化模糊"},{"level":2,"text":"语法驱动模糊测试","id":"语法驱动模糊测试"},{"level":2,"text":"协议状态模糊","id":"协议状态模糊"},{"level":2,"text":"结构感知变异（Struct-Aware Fuzzing）","id":"结构感知变异-struct-aware-fuzzing"},{"level":2,"text":"字典与魔术值注入","id":"字典与魔术值注入"},{"level":2,"text":"比较操作建模（CmpLog / Value Profile）","id":"比较操作建模-cmplog-value-profile"},{"level":2,"text":"模糊测试的工程实践要点","id":"模糊测试的工程实践要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"覆盖率引导模糊测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/fuzzing/coverage-guided-fuzzing"},"next":{"title":"变异测试的核心原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/mutation/mutation-testing-principles"}}